1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 2]

34
00:01:59,570 --> 00:02:00,070
Careful.

35
00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:20,330
Sir, this is it.

36
00:02:27,130 --> 00:02:28,180
This is where

37
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,260
you smelled the saltpeter and sulfur?

38
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:31,190
Yes.

39
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,840
Eighteen years ago,

40
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,400
this mine collapsed.

41
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:38,750
The tunnels inside are a maze.

42
00:02:39,250 --> 00:02:40,290
No one survived.

43
00:02:40,830 --> 00:02:43,120
If someone deliberately used it

44
00:02:43,830 --> 00:02:45,000
to lure you into a trap...

45
00:02:48,530 --> 00:02:50,000
That'll make it more interesting.

46
00:02:52,150 --> 00:02:54,430
Let's see what they're up to.

47
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:01,790
Wait.

48
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,440
Sir.

49
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:15,700
I smell burning

50
00:03:16,550 --> 00:03:17,540
saltpeter, sulfur, and charcoal.

51
00:03:19,410 --> 00:03:20,000
Get back.

52
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:30,400
Sir.

53
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:31,960
We're trapped inside.

54
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,720
Where are they?

55
00:03:40,290 --> 00:03:40,770
Sir.

56
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,460
- Sir.
- Sir.

57
00:03:42,790 --> 00:03:43,560
- Madam Xu.
- Sir.

58
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,800
They're all outside.

59
00:03:44,850 --> 00:03:46,050
- Madam Xu.
- Sir.

60
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,230
Sir.

61
00:03:48,110 --> 00:03:48,700
Sir.

62
00:03:51,850 --> 00:03:52,590
Lord Pei.

63
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,920
You think I lured you in here?

64
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:04,360
Let's go farther inside.

65
00:04:05,530 --> 00:04:06,910
Sir.

66
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:08,030
You don't have to help me.

67
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:08,850
I can walk.

68
00:04:11,820 --> 00:04:12,780
I'm holding you

69
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,360
so you can't run.

70
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,280
Hyah.

71
00:04:23,230 --> 00:04:24,300
Hyah. Hyah.

72
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,830
[Zhang Yue, Prince of Xin'an's Attendant]
Master, the mine's been blown up.

73
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:32,920
Pei Zhao hasn't come out.

74
00:04:34,060 --> 00:04:37,380
[Han Jin, Prince of Xin'an]
These tunnels are a maze.

75
00:04:38,030 --> 00:04:39,650
Until we find his body,

76
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,550
assume he's alive.

77
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:43,890
Go in and find him.

78
00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:45,920
Bring him back.

79
00:04:45,990 --> 00:04:48,000
Dead or alive.

80
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:49,710
Yes.

81
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:51,960
Sir.

82
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:53,720
The first time I met you,

83
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,270
I'd just escaped from this mine.

84
00:04:55,550 --> 00:04:56,680
There was a tremor that day.

85
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,540
Was that man-made too?

86
00:04:59,310 --> 00:05:01,010
How long did it take you
to escape last time?

87
00:05:02,100 --> 00:05:02,810
I don't remember.

88
00:05:03,130 --> 00:05:04,560
I kept passing out after I woke up.

89
00:05:04,650 --> 00:05:05,880
I had no idea how much time had passed.

90
00:05:06,570 --> 00:05:08,520
I fell down here around midnight.

91
00:05:08,940 --> 00:05:10,590
As soon as I escaped, I ran into you.

92
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,320
Quite a coincidence.

93
00:05:13,540 --> 00:05:14,930
Dawn to dusk, forever bound.

94
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,900
Burning flesh, no peace is found.

95
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,950
Blood to blood, our veins entwine.

96
00:05:19,330 --> 00:05:20,720
Miles apart, our hearts align.

97
00:05:21,250 --> 00:05:22,630
By this spell, I summon thee.

98
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,470
Life Gu, wake and answer me!

99
00:05:29,810 --> 00:05:31,490
Sir, look. We're out.

100
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:48,920
Sir.

101
00:05:50,110 --> 00:05:52,900
Why do these peach blossoms
look so different?

102
00:05:54,490 --> 00:05:55,520
They're blood-jade peach blossoms.

103
00:05:56,210 --> 00:05:58,240
Legend says those who see them

104
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,440
will be trapped
beneath the mine forever.

105
00:06:00,650 --> 00:06:02,110
The more beautiful something is,

106
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:03,540
the more poisonous it can be.

107
00:06:05,710 --> 00:06:07,370
We're already out of the mine.

108
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:28,550
What's that?

109
00:06:29,340 --> 00:06:29,750
Move.

110
00:06:42,310 --> 00:06:43,600
Sir, behind you.

111
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:52,920
Sir.

112
00:06:58,660 --> 00:06:59,140
Run.

113
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:29,740
Sir.

114
00:07:32,460 --> 00:07:33,370
Why aren't you leaving?

115
00:07:34,970 --> 00:07:35,950
You just saved me.

116
00:07:36,260 --> 00:07:37,260
How could I leave you?

117
00:07:38,070 --> 00:07:39,170
At least you have a conscience.

118
00:07:51,470 --> 00:07:51,920
Don't move.

119
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,900
Why does my heart hurt so badly

120
00:08:02,330 --> 00:08:03,460
when I touch her wound?

121
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,280
Could it be those Gu worms?

122
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,040
Sir.

123
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:12,770
Sir, your neck...

124
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:14,840
Don't move.

125
00:08:26,210 --> 00:08:27,200
Sir, they...

126
00:08:35,900 --> 00:08:36,340
Sir.

127
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:37,440
Sir.

128
00:08:37,570 --> 00:08:38,780
- Sir.
- Sir.

129
00:08:50,090 --> 00:08:51,280
You have a mother-child Gu.

130
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:53,030
When the child Gu is hurt,

131
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,430
the mother Gu suffers

132
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,210
a hundred times the pain.

133
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,120
How do we remove it?

134
00:08:59,610 --> 00:09:00,410
We don't know yet.

135
00:09:02,150 --> 00:09:03,640
You need to control your emotions.

136
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,610
The mother Gu is fiercely protective.

137
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:09,000
If it gets angry,

138
00:09:09,870 --> 00:09:11,300
your life could be in danger.

139
00:09:14,070 --> 00:09:15,550
So I have to stay by her side every day

140
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,330
and keep her happy?

141
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:18,800
For now, yes.

142
00:09:19,270 --> 00:09:20,710
Find a way to remove it soon.

143
00:09:22,580 --> 00:09:23,380
In my opinion,

144
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,380
we should lock her up first.

145
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:26,970
No need.

146
00:09:27,590 --> 00:09:29,380
Let her stay by my side.

147
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:30,560
It could work in our favor.

148
00:09:31,690 --> 00:09:32,450
How?

149
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:34,830
We'll use her as bait

150
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:36,280
to draw out whoever's behind this.

151
00:09:37,030 --> 00:09:39,320
With the child Gu right here,

152
00:09:39,620 --> 00:09:41,550
whoever implanted it won't
be able to stay away.

153
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:44,610
You're right.

154
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,170
Anyone who wants to hurt you

155
00:09:46,890 --> 00:09:47,890
will strike at her first.

156
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,840
We'll place men around her

157
00:09:51,140 --> 00:09:52,240
and catch them in the act.

158
00:09:54,890 --> 00:09:56,850
Guard Ji, if I hit the bullseye,

159
00:09:57,570 --> 00:09:58,360
teach me a few moves.

160
00:10:08,010 --> 00:10:08,400
Sir.

161
00:10:10,050 --> 00:10:10,800
What's she doing?

162
00:10:11,090 --> 00:10:12,300
Madam Xu, are you all right?

163
00:10:15,060 --> 00:10:15,920
What are you doing?

164
00:10:17,350 --> 00:10:17,790
- Sir.
- Sir.

165
00:10:18,730 --> 00:10:19,520
Unauthorized personnel

166
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,480
are not allowed on the training ground.

167
00:10:20,790 --> 00:10:21,520
Have you forgotten the rules?

168
00:10:25,270 --> 00:10:25,570
Sir.

169
00:10:28,830 --> 00:10:30,770
Come with me.

170
00:10:38,060 --> 00:10:39,600
Sir, I know how to make incense.

171
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,440
Chang'an said that
you're a light sleeper.

172
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,740
I can make incense to help you sleep.

173
00:10:45,090 --> 00:10:45,770
Ji Chang'an.

174
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,490
Twenty lashes.

175
00:10:48,070 --> 00:10:48,530
Yes, sir.

176
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,220
No, no.

177
00:10:50,650 --> 00:10:52,280
Guard Xiao and Guard Ji

178
00:10:52,830 --> 00:10:54,320
happened to mention it.

179
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,120
I overheard them.

180
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:55,870
It's not their fault.

181
00:11:02,550 --> 00:11:03,180
Remember this.

182
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:05,360
Never set foot
on the training ground again.

183
00:11:06,180 --> 00:11:06,500
Sir.

184
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:08,720
Your emotions.

185
00:11:10,870 --> 00:11:12,210
Impressive, Lord Pei.

186
00:11:17,180 --> 00:11:19,340
[Gu Qingyan, Crown Prince of Yong]

187
00:11:19,870 --> 00:11:20,870
Your Highness.

188
00:11:24,380 --> 00:11:26,770
Please join us in the main hall.

189
00:11:27,770 --> 00:11:28,050
Very well.

190
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:37,270
Young Master Yun.

191
00:11:38,650 --> 00:11:39,090
This way.

192
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,960
The Fengyi Bureau's
never admitted women.

193
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,080
Has that rule changed?

194
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,460
Never.

195
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:06,170
Who was that woman
at the training ground?

196
00:12:06,530 --> 00:12:07,490
An informant for the Fengyi Bureau.

197
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:08,870
Is that your concern too, Lord Yun?

198
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:09,960
No, I...

199
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:10,790
Let's get down to business.

200
00:12:13,550 --> 00:12:15,240
The Astronomical Bureau
observed the stars last night.

201
00:12:15,550 --> 00:12:16,860
The tremor at the Blood Jade Mine

202
00:12:17,340 --> 00:12:18,420
is said to be an ill omen.

203
00:12:19,270 --> 00:12:20,610
The Noble Consort's been unable
to sleep.

204
00:12:21,250 --> 00:12:22,570
She sent me to ask you

205
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,120
if you've made any progress.

206
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,440
There was no tremor.

207
00:12:26,150 --> 00:12:27,080
The mine collapsed

208
00:12:27,210 --> 00:12:28,380
because of a gunpowder explosion.

209
00:12:28,610 --> 00:12:29,090
Gunpowder?

210
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:30,600
Who did it?

211
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,540
Do we even need to investigate?

212
00:12:31,990 --> 00:12:33,290
It must have been the rebels.

213
00:12:33,510 --> 00:12:35,080
They've been working with the Wingless,

214
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:37,240
harassing the Tianxuan Mine
all the time.

215
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,480
Until they're wiped out,

216
00:12:38,750 --> 00:12:39,870
there will be no peace.

217
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:43,250
Since you're so certain,

218
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,750
perhaps

219
00:12:44,980 --> 00:12:46,380
you should handle the investigation.

220
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,080
Hmph.

221
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:50,070
I wouldn't dare take the credit
from you.

222
00:12:50,430 --> 00:12:50,850
Pei Zhao.

223
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:52,860
You have seven days

224
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:54,310
to uncover the truth.

225
00:12:55,550 --> 00:12:55,930
Yes, Your Highness.

226
00:12:58,740 --> 00:12:59,480
You may stop here.

227
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:00,280
No need to see me out.

228
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:08,140
[Fengyi Bureau]

229
00:13:17,870 --> 00:13:19,900
The Crown Prince's
Blood Jade Ritual failed.

230
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:22,000
Then there was the incident
at Tianxuan Mine.

231
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:23,790
I

232
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:26,720
[Yong]
order you to secretly investigate

233
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,150
and find out whether

234
00:13:28,460 --> 00:13:29,630
the two are connected.

235
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:30,890
Yes.

236
00:13:32,150 --> 00:13:34,480
No one may enter the Blood Jade Mine

237
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,270
without an imperial decree.

238
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:36,800
Even the Fengyi Bureau

239
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,290
needs His Majesty's authorization.

240
00:13:39,370 --> 00:13:40,500
The Blood Jade Ritual failed.

241
00:13:41,990 --> 00:13:43,550
The Crown Prince wasn't recognized
by the blood jade.

242
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,120
His position may be in jeopardy.

243
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,270
Could someone has sabotaged the ritual?

244
00:13:52,290 --> 00:13:54,000
Anyone capable of making such a move

245
00:13:55,250 --> 00:13:56,120
can't be an ordinary rebel.

246
00:13:56,870 --> 00:13:57,560
Any activity

247
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:58,660
at the Blood Jade Mine lately?

248
00:13:59,660 --> 00:14:00,380
Nothing unusual.

249
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:02,600
They probably know the Fengyi Bureau

250
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,330
is investigating,

251
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:05,060
so they're lying low.

252
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:08,680
Could it be an inside job at the mine?

253
00:14:10,030 --> 00:14:11,630
But the garrison commander, Chen Daohua,

254
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:12,890
was personally appointed by His Majesty.

255
00:14:14,140 --> 00:14:15,010
He won't be easy to investigate.

256
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:16,980
The Fengyi Bureau
has imperial authority.

257
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,800
We can investigate anyone,

258
00:14:19,050 --> 00:14:20,670
from commoners to the imperial family.

259
00:14:21,730 --> 00:14:22,260
Give the order.

260
00:14:22,750 --> 00:14:23,350
Leave no stone unturned.

261
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:25,060
Yes.

262
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:28,620
[Fengyi Bureau]

263
00:14:29,540 --> 00:14:30,570
If we find blood jade,

264
00:14:31,090 --> 00:14:32,180
we'll be rich.

265
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:54,350
I found some.

266
00:14:54,410 --> 00:14:55,390
Blood jade.

267
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:19,250
Cause of death?

268
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,390
My lord,

269
00:15:21,870 --> 00:15:23,620
these bodies bear no wounds,

270
00:15:24,110 --> 00:15:25,630
yet their mouths hold Blood Jade shards,

271
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:27,430
and no signs of poisoning.

272
00:15:28,190 --> 00:15:29,050
My preliminary conclusion is

273
00:15:30,160 --> 00:15:32,570
they died of sudden cardiac arrest.

274
00:15:33,350 --> 00:15:34,030
Time of death?

275
00:15:34,820 --> 00:15:36,510
Around 3:45 p.m.

276
00:15:38,630 --> 00:15:39,630
They were stealing blood jade?

277
00:15:41,930 --> 00:15:42,290
We wouldn't dare.

278
00:15:42,290 --> 00:15:43,620
I swear to Heaven,

279
00:15:43,790 --> 00:15:45,600
they'd never dare steal blood jade.

280
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:47,950
Who is Liu Asi's wife?

281
00:15:50,710 --> 00:15:51,200
My lord.

282
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:53,070
Liu Asi is my husband.

283
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,780
How many times did he steal blood jade?

284
00:15:56,970 --> 00:15:58,670
Just twice.

285
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:00,510
Madam Liu.

286
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,160
Don't talk nonsense.

287
00:16:03,970 --> 00:16:04,540
My lord.

288
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,300
My husband wasn't being greedy.

289
00:16:08,020 --> 00:16:09,760
He just wanted money to treat our child.

290
00:16:10,500 --> 00:16:11,810
Please have mercy.

291
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:13,600
If you want to live, tell me the truth.

292
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:16,030
How did they get the blood jade out?

293
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:17,960
They found it.

294
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,110
Found it?

295
00:16:27,680 --> 00:16:28,270
My lord.

296
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:29,480
Right here.

297
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,610
They found it here.

298
00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:01,660
- Run.
- Go. Hurry.

299
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:18,830
Go.

300
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:26,550
Help.

301
00:17:27,070 --> 00:17:27,700
What's going on?

302
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:29,800
Crows. Crows.

303
00:17:30,510 --> 00:17:31,410
Lord Pei is in danger.

304
00:17:31,630 --> 00:17:32,140
Run.

305
00:17:33,870 --> 00:17:35,270
Sir, I'll help you.

306
00:17:35,370 --> 00:17:35,830
Sir.

307
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:38,570
Don't use your swords.

308
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:39,880
Crow blood burns flesh.

309
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:40,980
Crows fear the color red.

310
00:17:58,850 --> 00:17:59,860
You can't fight.

311
00:18:00,450 --> 00:18:01,400
Why did you come?

312
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,000
Sir.

313
00:18:03,300 --> 00:18:04,140
I came to help.

314
00:18:04,150 --> 00:18:05,230
I smelled Sichuan pepper.

315
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:06,350
Sichuan pepper?

316
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:08,160
Explain yourself clearly

317
00:18:08,290 --> 00:18:09,000
or get out.

318
00:18:22,610 --> 00:18:24,640
The Fengyi Bureau
investigates injustice.

319
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:27,070
I must stay here.

320
00:18:30,690 --> 00:18:32,530
They keep only the useful.

321
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:36,690
I shall be of use.

322
00:18:55,790 --> 00:18:56,200
Sir.

323
00:18:56,810 --> 00:18:57,420
She's drawing again.

324
00:18:58,110 --> 00:18:58,410
Hmm.

325
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,340
Four people.

326
00:19:01,250 --> 00:19:01,820
Interesting.

327
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:04,120
People?

328
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:05,850
She didn't draw people.

329
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:08,460
She used animals instead.

330
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:09,890
The snake is sinister.

331
00:19:10,350 --> 00:19:11,000
The wolf is vicious.

332
00:19:11,450 --> 00:19:12,040
The tiger is savage.

333
00:19:12,590 --> 00:19:13,450
The fox is cunning.

334
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,680
Just a few strokes,

335
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:16,580
yet they look so lifelike.

336
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:17,780
She's a skilled artist.

337
00:19:18,570 --> 00:19:19,810
And she knows a great deal
about incense.

338
00:19:20,390 --> 00:19:21,310
No ordinary woman

339
00:19:21,620 --> 00:19:22,620
could possibly know all this.

340
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:24,980
Keep a close eye on her.

341
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:26,270
We'll use her as bait

342
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:28,210
and draw out whoever's behind her.

343
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:29,980
All right.

344
00:19:31,910 --> 00:19:32,280
Sir.

345
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:33,750
Someone from the palace is here.

346
00:19:33,750 --> 00:19:34,590
You've been summoned.

347
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:36,630
Let's go.

348
00:19:56,560 --> 00:19:59,370
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

349
00:20:00,990 --> 00:20:04,180
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

350
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,240
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

351
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:12,180
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

352
00:20:14,340 --> 00:20:17,010
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

353
00:20:18,230 --> 00:20:23,240
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

354
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:31,590
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

355
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:40,480
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

356
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:49,150
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

357
00:20:49,530 --> 00:20:58,400
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

358
00:20:58,830 --> 00:21:07,320
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
